  "sentences": [
    {"text": "The long, arrow-straight road stretched into the distance, wavering in the heat.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "A narrow, winding lane curved gently between the fields.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "Colossal, rumbling lorries thundered past, rattling the windows in their frames.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "Dense, slow-moving traffic crawled nose to tail all the way into the city.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "A car took the sharp, hazardous bend too fast and screeched to a halt inches from the wall.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "The van hit the treacherous, icy surface and skidded across the carriageway.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "A bus splashed through the puddles and drenched everyone at the stop.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Harsh, dazzling headlights swept across the hedges and were gone.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "The steep, serpentine mountain road climbed towards the pass in a dozen hairpin bends.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "The road forked at the signpost, and neither name was one they recognised.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Cars hurtled past in a blur on the roaring, six-lane motorway.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "The lights flashed from amber to red, and the drivers behind hooted impatiently.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "The smooth, black tarmac glistened in the rain like the back of a seal.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Wet, gleaming pavements reflected the red, blinking tail lights of the cars ahead.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "The congested main road led out of the town past factories and warehouses.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "The old truck lurched and jolted along the dusty, rutted track.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "The lonely country road vanished into the darkness beyond the last street lamp.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "A fox ran out, and the driver swerved to avoid it.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "The road dipped under the railway bridge, where it always flooded.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Beyond the farm, the lane narrowed to a single track with grass growing down its spine.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Nothing moved on the dark, desolate road except a sheet of newspaper tumbling in the wind.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "The wide, tree-lined street was dappled with shade.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "Deep, water-filled potholes made cycling a matter of nerve.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "They lived on a quiet side street where children still played outside.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "Thick, grey exhaust fumes hung over the junction.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "The dim, unlit tunnel swallowed the car, and for a moment they were nowhere at all.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "For mile after mile, the road snaked through the hills.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Rain hammered the tarmac, and the wind flung branches across the road.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "Seen from the hillside at night, the motorway was a river of gold flowing one way and rubies the other.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "In autumn the avenue became a tunnel of flame-coloured leaves.", "vibe": "Beautiful"}
